  "description": "ModernProgressRing.WinForms is an ultra-smooth, hardware-accelerated circular progress bar and indeterminate loading spinner for C# Windows Forms applications. Built with pure GDI+ vector graphics, it features 60 FPS smooth interpolation, dual-tone neon gradients, rounded end-caps, center metric displays, 2 theme modes (Dark/Light), and 5 built-in design styles (DashboardPremium, FluentGlass, MaterialFlat, SoftNeumorphic, Cyberpunk). Multi-targeted for .NET Framework 4.7.2, 4.8, .NET 6 Windows, and .NET 8 Windows.",
